.SH DESCRIPTION
Async\-signal\-safe signal handler installed for \f[CR]SIGINT\f[R],
\f[CR]SIGTERM\f[R], \f[CR]SIGCHLD\f[R], and \f[CR]SIGPIPE\f[R] in the
server\(cqs main process.
.PP
The handler only sets \f[CR]volatile sig_atomic_t\f[R] flags, which are
then checked by the main accept loop.
It does not perform any non\-reentrant operations (no \f[CR]malloc\f[R],
no \f[CR]printf\f[R], no \f[CR]write\f[R]).
.PP
